es Microsoft prerequisite installation and may require administrator approval.\n\nSource commit: fb9f46f247e2ed4f6b2ee849e67b4b7d9afbdb11\nSource tree: 60422257ce3c47f3eb83b291b02a84d4c75add8a (scope in release-provenance.json).\n\nApp and UiaHost are framework-dependent; Maintenance is self-contained. Updates use full packages. Delta is generated only; delta application is not claimed.\n\nSee INSTALLATION.md and verify SHA256.json. Public user-path acceptance is recorded separately from build/package success.\n"}